Megawati Wijaya August 27 , 2009 .
Singapore faces a 'silver tsunami ' From { http : //www.atimes.com/atimes/Southeast_Asia/KH27Ae01.html } [ HYPERLINK : http : //www.atimes.com/atimes/Southeast_Asia/KH27Ae01.html ]
