Engineers rarely identify a " need " but rather let the society discover it .
" Need " here refers to a desire or shortage of a commodity , and sometimes this " need " can be considered as a neccessity or a form of luxury .
For example , Tetsuya Mizoguchi , an engineer from Toshiba Corporation , saw the need for portable personal computers and came up with the idea of laptop ; and as of recently , one of the human needs that have gained unremitting attention would be transportation .
Based on a study in the U.S done by Ecobridge , about 33 % of carbon dioxide emission comes from the burning of gasoline in internal-combustion engines of cars and trucks .
As the struggle between man and nature continues to be unabated , it is the engineers ' job to design cars that are environmental-friendly to mitigate what has already been done to our environment .
According to Khandani ( 2005 ) , the engineering design process can be used to tackle such needs .
First of all , we have to define the problem clearly .
The process of defining a problem involves identifying a need , developing a problem statement and establishing a criterion for success .
It must be clear , concise and unambiguous to avoid any ambiguity .
Next , it would be to gather pertinent information regarding environmental-friendly cars .
This can be done through the use of internet , library or even encyclopedias .
According to Khandani ( 2005 ) , gathering pertinent information can reveal facts about the problem which might in turn result in a redefinition of the problem .
Subsequently , it would be to generate multiple solutions .
Creativity is one of the biggest emphases in this step in order to generate techincal solutions to the problem .
Team brainstorming sessions are also conducted to develop multiple solutions , reckoning on team dynamics .
Engineers must also be willing to take risks and make mistakes , and not to be afraid of being criticized for their ideas .
For example , the team that invented hydrogen fueled cars faced several setbacks before they could attain their goal .
Lastly , it would be to select a solution and implement it .
Analysis of all possible solutions is to be done and reasons of why the final solution overrides the others must be clear .
In the design of environmental-friendly cars , it must be in such a way that the designed car would be less polluting than the existing ones , coupled with lower price and better performance .
In conclusion , engineers today now shoulder the responsibility of striking a balance between man and nature .
Greenhouse emissions must be reduced to the lowest level as much as possible .
Designing a car that reduces greenhouse emissions significantly definitely poses a great challenge to them , and they should use engineering design process to help them in designing .
Nonetheless , at the rate of how man has been working on this , one can expect to see a big leap in car designs in the coming years .
