There are many different types of engineering disciplines in Singapore .
Basically , according to Jonathan Dunder ( p.2 - 9 ) , there are eight different types of engineering .
These are the architectural , biomedical , civil , computer , electrical , industrial , mechanical and software engineering .
Each serves different engineering industries .
For architectural , it is more related to designing of buildings for commercial , residential and industrial purposes .
As for biomedical , it is the design of devices intended to be used in medicine .
Civil engineering is the focus of structuring designs for infrastructure such as bridges and roads .
Electrical engineering is the designing of electronics , software engineering is the designing of software applications that relates to operating system whereas computer engineering is the combination of software and electronic engineering which focuses on both the engineering design .
Industrial engineering is the designing of multiple manufacturing products while lastly mechanical engineering , which is the oldest of the engineering field , is the designing of the mechanical systems .
There are so many engineering fields .
So what is engineering actually ?
According to Jonathan Dunder ( p.1 ) , engineering is the designing , troubleshooting and testing of products that science , mathematics , physics and the technology .
Designing of engineering innovation may take up to several years of processes to see the ideal final output product coming to reality .
Innovation involves three different stages of journey .
There is the creativity , when several ideas come to mind , followed by the process where these ideas slowly turn to reality by the organization .
Finally is the entrepreneurship process where innovations are introduced into the new market .
During these stages of innovation , different problems are faced by engineers . Some of these problems are significant enough that may affect the progress \ development of the innovation
Problems do occur in Singapore during each and every innovating design by the engineers .
Here , two of the major problems will be discussed .
Engineers are needed in the entire process of every innovation to plan , troubleshoot , build and install the equipments in order to make the innovation a successful one .
Experienced engineers are needed in the organization to speed up the innovation process .
So here , in Singapore , the first major problem faced in the innovation designing process is the high salaries by the senior , experienced engineers and the fresh graduate engineers from the ITEs , Polytechnics as well as the Universities .
, a statistics report done by 3.5 million members in terms of the numbers of working years singular in the engineering world , shows that the longer the singular , the higher the qualification and the higher the monthly wages will be
The ageing-population in Singapore will increase tremendously delete this phrase and insert 'and ' only 40-45 % of graduates in ITEs , Polytechnics and Universities are trained in some form of . ( Organizations in Singapore , in order to proceed with their innovations , have no choice but to turn to the more senior and experienced engineers .
This will in fact slow down the process of innovation as the organizations in Singapore have to think of ways to increase their innovation budgets to pay the engineers .
Next , is the lack of land resources in Singapore .
Singapore is a small country and it has limited area of land .
The population of Singapore will increase from the current 4.8 million people to 6.5 million people in the coming years
Therefore there will be not enough land area to build industries for the organizations as most part of the land will be used to build flats for the increasing population .
It will cost more and it will be hard for the organization in order to be in Singapore to proceed with the engineering innovation process .
Infrastructure will also be a problem for the organization due to lack of land area .
In conclusion , it is not an easy process for an innovation to be out in the market .
Organizations in other countries too meet many significant difficulties during their innovation designing process .
But there are a few successful innovations by organizations in Singapore such as Creative Technology .
