China is a developing country .
On her way to be more modern , one of the key points is to improve engineering design ability .
However , in China , there are some problems humping the developing of engineering designs .
From my point of view , two of the main problems are the government system and people 's minds .
We need a more complete governmental and legal system .
Some government officials do not do well in their positions and sometimes there are official corruptions in government .
For example , when somebody or some companies want to apply new techniques into practice , in some certain situations , they have to ask the government for singular - permission .
Because of these types of officials , this process can cost a long . Hence the companies lose precious time .
Moreover , if the techniques can bring generous benefits to the company , some officials may use all kinds of excuses to delay or even refuse to give permission until they get bribes from the company .
In some other cases , in order to protect big companies , officials may prevent new techniques and engineering designs from coming into certain areas .
In modern society , 3G techniques brings a new revolution in cell phone and information industry .
But 3G hand phones did not appear in China until very late .
The reason was that at that time some giant communication company did not have that technique they were afraid that their profitable old businesses may be replaced by 3G business .
So they collaborated with some officials to protect their own benefits .
China also needs new policies and laws .
For instance , because the patent law is not strict enough , there many pirated copies of software , books , and techniques .
The result is people who invent the new techniques can not benefit from them and nobody is willing to do new engineering designs .
Besides the problems in governmental system , some social conventional concepts can also obstruct the improvement of engineering designs .
Many have got used to the old things .
They just want to do the same things every day .
They are afraid that they can not control changes in their daily lives
These people may never think about inventing new techniques .
Moreover , they may also block other persons ' way to innovate , because they think the men are showing off or have bad effects on their lives .
This concept has negative influences . On the one hand people do not want to do new engineering designs and discourage others to do so .
On the other hand , even though there are new techniques which can make a difference , people do not want to use it .
As a , seldom can designs be applied into practice .
Inventors become less and less .
The two problems mentioned above are serious in China .
They have bad effects on the development of engineering techniques in China .
However , as the world becomes more competitive and " smaller " , the government and public have realized the importance of sane policy and innovation .
I believe in the near future we can do much better .
Correct defects in vision
Research shows that , the World Health Organization assumes that about 80 % of all disabled people worldwide live in developing countries .
It is also estimated that there are 600 million disabled people worldwide , which is about 10 % of the world population .
Among these disabled people , the World Health Organization estimates that 27-35 million people are blind in the world , of which about 20 % live Africa and 65 % live in Asia .
Moreover , 14-17 million people have serious visual damage .
The number of blind is rising . Firstly because of rapid increase in population size in developing countries ; and second despite of increased longevity , ageing is related to visual loss from cataract , glaucoma and macular degeneration .
That is why it is hard to make prediction in future numbers of blind because of unknown quantity in population growth .
Hence , the first solution is to invent and innovate equipments that help combat blindness .
Building eye treatment centres is another way to reduce blindness .
The last thing that can not be left out is giving proper jobs and appropriate training for blind people .
First of all , engineers have to fabricate products which combat blindness , that are user- friendly and low cost .
For instance , a device which creates an image of the visual world on the retina is part of the central nervous system of the brain .
We will introduce not only new paradigms of instructions but also new approaches to deliver this up to date equipments .
Moreover , we will help to assemble resources , alleviate coactions and provide specialized expertise in non-visual human perception to assist and invent new effective and courteous technologies to increase non-visual capabilities .
Secondly , it is important to build eye treatment centers where patients can get treatment and buy the optical equipment .
Additionally , an attempt will be made to work with private initiators in order to build treatment centers which is run only by people who are blind visually damaged. .
Though the special treatment for blind and visually damaged people is a once- only expense , it is very expensive .
So to finance these expenses , we have to set up community service activities such as fund raising .
The final solution is offering proper jobs and giving appropriate training for blind people .
According to the research the amount of blind people in work is decreasing .
It is getting even lower : from 33 % blind working people in 1995 to 29 % in 1998 ( Harris , 1998 ) .Therefore , in order them to make progress , new possibilities and new occupational areas are needed .
In conclusion , blind people should also have same opportunities as everyone . This to get freedom from extreme limitation , to accomplish and to be able to have confidence
so that other people give respect to them .
Moreover , their passions are the same as others .
They too have same dreams and assurance that they can reach their targets .
If blind people get the same chance as sighted people , they surely can achieve the same quality of life .
