There is an observation made by Morrow Bourne : " Age is a prison from which we can not escape " .
Indeed , aging is a natural process that everyone will experience .
Due to the effects of aging , some people may suffer from physical and mental depreciation .
As people are a country 's most precious resource , the government should help its people when they are suffering from ageing problems .
In recent decades , many countries have invested a certain amount of money in areas such as science and technology , to develop new products such as an intelligent system , iShoe and big button TV remote control that would help the elderly .
I certainly agree that these developments have greatly helped to ease the aging process .
With the help of technology , scientists have created an intelligent system that helped the elderly to remember everyday tasks .
( 1 ) CITATION AnI091 \ l 1033 ( An Intelligent System Helps Elderly Or Memory-impaired To Remember Everyday Tasks , 2009 ) . " Research has shown that aging may affect memory , changing the way the brain stores information and making it harder to recall stored information
" ( Memory Loss With Aging ) . Consequently , older people will forget things more easily .
For instance , some of the elderly may be unable to recall some daily activities such as taking medicine , bringinalong with them their cell phones or keys when they are leaving the house .
to solve these problems , a team of researchers have created a system that ususes sensors to identify human actions and mobile devices to remind the elderly to perform daily activities .
( 3 ) CITATION AnI091 \ l 1033 ( An Intelligent System Helps Elderly Or Memory-impaired To Remember Everyday Tasks , 2009 ) . As a result , they are able to carry out their everyday tasks as usual .
One of the graduate students from Harvard-MIT Division of Health Sciences and Technology has developed an iShoe that prevents the elderly from falling .
( 4 ) CITATION DAV08 \ l 1033 ( HO , 2008 ) . The iShoe contains a device that measures and records human movements .
In addition , it helps to stimulate the feet and alert the elderly when they lose their balance .
Using these data , the elderly can look for a doctor for early diagnosis .
Therefore , their balance can be improved and they are able to lead a better life .
Tek Partner , who provides technology consultants to clients , has invented a big button TV remote control to help elderly who have visual problems .
( 5 ) CITATION Agi1 \ l 1033 ( Aging and Technology Research , 2005 ) . Research has shown that older people will experience some common visual problems such as tearing , floaters and glare .
( 6 ) CITATION Agi \ l 1033 ( Aging and Technology Research , 2005 ) . Consequently , they are unable to focus and see objects clearly .
With large size of buttons , older people are able to see and operate the control without any help .
To conclude , science and technology have help in developing products to ease the aging process .
For instance , the intelligent system is invented to help the elderly to remember their daily tasks .
This is because as people get older , they will forget things more frequently .
Therefore , they need a system to remind them to perform certain activities .
iShoe , is another product that is developed using science and technology to prevent the elderly from falling down .
It helps to monitor human movements and provides a warning if any balancing problem is found .
As a result , the elderly can improve their balance by approaching the balancing specialist earlier .
Lastly , a big button TV remote control is created to help seniors who are unable to see certain images clearly .
With the help from the control , they are able to operate the television , VCD and DVD player independently .
In conclusion , the elderly are able to lead a better life with the help of all these products .
