A promising way to solve the energy problem
With not much fossil fuel left on earth , it is impossible to meet the increasing energy demand which is predicted to double by 2050 in the following years if the energy system keeps its current energy structure .
( Declan Butler , 2004 ) .
Under these circumstance , scientists have come up with very high temperature reactor ( VHTR ) to make use of energy in a safer and more efficient way .
However , its feature , very high temperature , leads to a lot of concerns from the public .
People wonder if there exists a suitable material to build this reactor .
They are concerned about the probability of radioactivity leaking .
And they think it is not a good business in terms of the cost to make this reactor run properly and safely .
Although some of the technological problems have not been conquered , the current research and data can tell us that we are not far from those aims .
Through more research , we can make this proposal come true .
Firstly , people wonder whether scientists can find a suitable material that can withstand such high temperature , more than 1000 , compared to that of the current nuclear reactor which is less 330 .
( World nuclear association , 2009 ) .
It is true that there is a huge jump between these two levels , but that does not necessarily mean it is impossible .
In 2004 , Japan did a test on a nuclear plant in which the temperature reached 950 .
( Declan Butler , 2004 ) Besides the encouraging practice experience , scientists also found some amazing ways to reach much higher temperature theoretically .
Scientists can use a certain way to significantly increase the thermal property .
They can even get a kind of materialZrCwhich has a melting point of 3540 .
( James W. Sterbentz , n.d. ) .
It is estimated that the first VHTR can be built around 2020 .
If the research in the material is financially supported well , this material obstacle will be overcome by that time .
Secondly , some people are concerned about leakage of radioactivity after a period of running although the reactor maybe good enough to hold all radioactivity inside at the beginning .
Scientifically speaking , this problem belongs to the life of material area .
As mentioned in the last paragraph , the material that will be used to build the reactor can withstand the high temperature .
Consequently , the only aspect left is the corrosion factor .
The most serious corrosion factor is due to the radiation .
That is why engineers have set the timeline to replace some certain parts of the reactor that may not be safe after some years .
For instance , the graphite should be replaced every 4 to 10 years .
( U.S .
DOE nuclear energy research advisory committee , 2009 ) .
The other common aspect that may have some influence in the safety area is the reaction between coolant and the crust of the reactor which may directly results in radioactive leakage and even explosions .
However , it is not a big problem for VHTR because the coolant of this reactor is helium , which is an inert gas .
It does not react with the crust even though it is under the high temperature .
That is to say , the possibility of radiation leaking closes to zero in the VHTR .
Thirdly , some people do not think that we can get enough benefit if we build this reactor at such high expense .
It is indeed quite expensive to build such a reactor but we can not look down upon the benefit that we will get after the reactor works .
According to the design , VHTR could squeeze 50 % more electricity from the same amount of fuel comparing to the traditional reactors and it also can produce hydrogen at the same time which is considered as an ideal energy .
( Shuwen " Eric " Wang , 2005 ) .
VHTR is worth building .
In conclusion , the VHTR is a safe and efficient nuclear plant .
It is no doubt that scientists can overcome the obstacles to find a suitable material and make sure the reactor will never leak any radiation .
And the cost of building VHTR is likely to decrease since the technology and knowledge is improved .
Now the most important thing we should do is to support the research in this topic and make sure the schedule goes smoothly .
